# 统一行尾与二进制判定
#
# 为什么需要它：本机 git 开了 core.autocrlf，每次 add/commit 都会刷一堆
#   "warning: in the working copy of '…', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it"
# 这些警告既噪音大，又意味着**同一个文件在不同机器上 checkout 出来的字节不同**。
# 显式声明后行为确定：仓库里一律 LF，工作区也保持 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 文本：明确按文本处理，参与 diff ----
*.md    text
*.py    text
*.js    text
*.cjs   text
*.json  text
*.html  text
*.css   text
*.svg   text
*.sh    text
*.ps1   text
*.txt   text

# 例外：Windows 批处理只能是 CRLF —— cmd.exe 解析 if/for 代码块时对 LF 结尾不可靠
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.bat   text eol=crlf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何换行转换（否则文件会被写坏）----
*.blend   binary
*.blend1  binary
*.blend2  binary
*.glb     binary
*.gltf    binary
*.fbx     binary
*.stl     binary
*.3mf     binary
*.step    binary
*.stp     binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.webp    binary
*.psd     binary
*.pdf     binary
*.docx    binary
*.xlsx    binary
*.pptx    binary
*.mp4     binary
*.zip     binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary
